<http://data.silknow.org/object/3cf53102-fc49-34c9-9097-9e281dbe06ec>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Silk ribbon, the width of which is filled by three stripes of arched compartments; brown and white, pink and white and emerald green and white. The white has a surface bound twill, the colours in satin. The compartments are defined by an edging of pale pink silk, and through them run pale pink stems bearing small, angular flowers imitating those in woven shawls. The flowers are in black and golden yellow and are formed by weft threads. The ribbon has narrow black selvedges."@en , "Silk ribbon, France, 1830-1860."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/fe93faaa-a71d-3742-bba2-92df1104cfc9> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Silk ribbon, France, 1830-1860."@en , "Silk ribbon, the width of which is filled by three stripes of arched compartments; brown and white, pink and white and emerald green and white. The white has a surface bound twill, the colours in satin. The compartments are defined by an edging of pale pink silk, and through them run pale pink stems bearing small, angular flowers imitating those in woven shawls. The flowers are in black and golden yellow and are formed by weft threads. The ribbon has narrow black selvedges."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/3cf53102-fc49-34c9-9097-9e281dbe06ec/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/3cf53102-fc49-34c9-9097-9e281dbe06ec/dimension/1> ;
